<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark June 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark June 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pfandbrief was announced by joint lead managers Dresner, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Commerzbank and Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.90     PAY DATE  S 17.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    FFURT     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
